            "author_handle": "",
            "headline": "Wood Deck 16x32",
            "social_icon": "facebook",
            "review_text": "Deck was perfect. My landscapers installed it and one of them happens to be a framer by trade. He was impressed by how it went together rather quickly. It took them about 2 hours to put together. Whereas if they would have built it from scratch would have taken a full day. He said he would recommend this deck if anyone was looking to have one built. That speaks volumes! I am glad I found your company and I will recommend that people purchase this item from you if they are looking for a deck. And just as advertised with all the bits and pieces that went to put it together. Everything was there and everything went smoothly. I couldn't be more pleased!"
          }
