            "headline": "16 x 28 grey composite deck",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "I ordered the 16 x 28 composite deck in grey, with 39 inch risers, for my front porch. It went together very well. I love it. I am so happy with it that I ordered another 16 x 28 for my back porch. The front is finished except the gazebo and rod iron railings ( which will be later).\nThe back porch is almost finished, and I ordered another smaller deck for my sliding glass door. 5 star."
          }
        },
