            "headline": "Composite Deck 16x20 ",
            "social_icon": "google",
            "review_text": "Great service with a real effort towards the customer. Can’t complain a bit. I loved the approach of “here is what we understand and how we are proceeding, if this doesn’t work for you please let us know, no need to get back with us if everything is ok”. I missed a call or two along the way and this was the approach taken. Information provided in the messages was detailed so I was well informed, I had the opportunity to make a correction if necessary and if all was good then there was no need to follow up. I hate when companies just say to call them back with no info and it was something completely trivial and wasting my time. The A-DIY approach was PERFECT for me as it progressed the order and I was fully informed even if I missed the call."
