            "author_handle": "",
            "headline": "",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "I had a fantastic experience from start to finish and can highly recommend this company. The whole process was smooth, professional and stress free. Customer service was excellent, always available, even after the initial purchase and delivery. That level of support really made a difference. The delivery was also great. Everything arrived exactly as expected and in perfect condition. Most importantly, the deck looks amazing. It was fairly easy to install, being this my first ever big DIY project (never used a drill and never worked with wood before). I am extremely happy with the final results and would definitely recommend them to anyone looking for quality products and outstanding service."
          }
        },
