            "is_3_star": false,
            "author_name": "Sandra",
            "author_handle": "",
            "headline": "It will take two people, but so worth it.",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "The communication was great during the order and shipping process. The boards were cut perfectly and once we found the video instructions it was fairly easy to assemble. You will need 2 people to assemble the base, but one person can easily finish the top and skirt boards.\nI also used a sealant because I live in Florida and summers are wicked.\nIt took quite a while to receive my kit, but they updated me quickly when I made inquiries. I have a gravel driveway. The driver chose to wait until the end of the day, to unload my crate so that he could back down my driveway and not leave it sitting on the curb. I really appreciated that. He was gracious and did the best he could to get it as close to the site as possible.\nThe deck is amazing. I love using it. I put a protective pad under my firepit and plan on using it until it gets too hot.\n12' X 12' is large enough for 4 Adirondack chairs, 2 footstools, 2 small tables and a small square firepit."
          }
        },
