            "author_handle": "",
            "headline": "",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "We built a full 16x20 deck in one weekend with the A DIY kit.  Just me, my wife, and a drill. No contractors, no measuring, no guessing. Every single piece was labeled, organized, and easy to follow.\n\nThe best part? It goes together like legos for adults. We saved thousands doing it ourselves and actually enjoyed the process. Well… most of it. These kinds of projects definitely test your marriage 🤣🤣\n\nThe instructions were clear, the kit was complete, and the results look like something we waited months for… but we built it ourselves. I’ve never seen a DIY product this well thought out and user-friendly. If you want a deck fast and don’t want to deal with contractors, this is it.\n\nWe are blown away. Thank you for giving us our favorite space in our new home."
          }
        },
