            "headline": "Was a fun project",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "It was a fun project! I'm no carpenter by any means! I've always wanted a deck for my small backyard but 10s of thousands of dollars will never be in my budget. My 93 year old grandmother stays with me and now she can walk comfortably out the back door and enjoy the outside gathering. My friend and I put it up in a day and a half. We raised it from its designed height and built steps. Everything was in the neatly organized crate!! I didn't see a single board! My friend and I had fun and my Grandma was over the moon. Just need Deck railing and possibly a pergola. The price was right!!"
          }
        },
